Sure, you can outrun a ghost.  But if your being pounded by the same
monsters that killed you last time it doesn't help to have the ghost
catch-up to you and assist them.

To get rid of a ghost lead it up a staircase just as you would your pet.
Then, outrun it and return to the level below.


